  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that config_014 (pca_n2000 RNA, imagenet_vit_l image, avgpool, weighted fusion) achieves the highest accuracy so far (0.635). This experiment tests whether changing the fusion method from weighted to concat (while keeping other parameters identical) impacts performance. This isolates the effect of fusion strategy, a critical design choice, and helps determine if the current best's success depends on weighted fusion or if simpler methods could match it. It balances exploitation (building on config_014's strong foundation) and exploration (testing a key hyperparameter)."
